{"2787460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CONCRETE VISIONS", "steam_appid": 2787460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Concrete Visions</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concrete Visions is a first-person psychological thriller video game with survival horror, FPS and beat’em up elements. There are two main components to the gameplay - melee / lite arms combat and environmental exploration as you strive to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily influenced by games such as Condemned: Criminal Origins,  Fahrenheit: Indigo Prophecy &amp; Anatomy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's combat is built primarily around melee with firearms available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787460/extras/28944e3b2f61f478c24231cef46282f8.poster.avif?t=1776189648\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787460/extras/28944e3b2f61f478c24231cef46282f8.webm?t=1776189648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787460/extras/28944e3b2f61f478c24231cef46282f8.mp4?t=1776189648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal with Concrete Visions is to combine a disturbing photo sourced lo-fi atmosphere with nightmarish aesthetics in order to create a replayable gameplay experience for horror and retro FPS fans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>STORY</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town of Stonebrook is desolate and all of the residents have disappeared. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All that remains are the junkies, the dregs, &amp; the scum, and every one of them is out for blood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Malone is a cult-like leader for these cretins, and you are certain he is responsible for the hordes of bastards on your tail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through these cold streets and wild overgrowth on a quest for answers, safety, and freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s time to put fist to concrete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloody Fists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead Pipes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kitchen Knives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Revolver  &amp; A Shotgun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crisps for Health OR Tasty Health Snacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Unhinged Enemies That See You As Their Prey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutally Visceral Melee Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Chilling OST</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unnerving Photo-Sourced Environments &amp; Character models</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets a plenty - See if you can locate <i><strong>DOSMan</strong></i> in each level – chances are he’ll have something very helpful for your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787460/extras/85e719152532398143646da7e8aaf75a.poster.avif?t=1776189648\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787460/extras/85e719152532398143646da7e8aaf75a.webm?t=1776189648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787460/extras/85e719152532398143646da7e8aaf75a.mp4?t=1776189648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CONTROLS:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement &amp; Aim</strong> - WASD + Mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact/open doors</strong> - E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flashlight</strong> - F</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch Weapons</strong> - Scroll Wheel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump</strong> - Space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crouch</strong> - Ctrl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot Firearm / Melee Attack</strong> - LMB​</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punch</strong> - LMB for Left Fist &amp; RMB for Right Fist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​<strong>Reload Firearm</strong> - R</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Cover Art by Joe Roman (Chito)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Concrete Visions</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Concrete Visions is a first-person psychological thriller video game with survival horror, FPS and beat’em up elements. There are two main components to the gameplay - melee / lite arms combat and environmental exploration as you strive to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily influenced by games such as Condemned: Criminal Origins,  Fahrenheit: Indigo Prophecy &amp; Anatomy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 